Usage

  Single GPU:
  cd src
  python train.py --fp16

  Multi-GPU with Accelerate:
  accelerate launch --config_file ../accelerate_config.yaml src/train.py

  With HuggingFace Trainer (recommended for auto batch size):
  python src/train_hf.py --fp16 --epochs 3

  Command-line options:
  python train.py \
    --model_name FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base \
    --data_dir data/resources/decisions \
    --output_dir outputs \
    --epochs 3 \
    --batch_size 8 \
    --learning_rate 5e-5 \
    --fp16
